WEBVTT

00:00:02.042 --> 00:00:08.645
Settings → Sharing: give someone or an app access, without your password.

00:00:08.695 --> 00:00:12.742
A share link: choose a name, how long it works and which pages.

00:00:12.792 --> 00:00:15.868
The link is ready to copy; you can revoke it any time.

00:00:15.918 --> 00:00:20.604
Each app and token gets a role: your own agent, the primary AI coach that gives your daily advice, or an advisory AI coach for a second opinion and proposals.

00:00:20.654 --> 00:00:25.669
There is always exactly one primary AI coach. A new app starts as advisory, until you choose.

00:00:25.719 --> 00:00:32.857
A token gives an AI app (MCP) access. Choose what it may do.
